<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ban Borić</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. 1154–1163</span> · <a href="/centuries/12th-century">12th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ban Borić was the first ruler of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bosnia">Bosnia</a> known by name, recorded as ban in 1154 as a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassal</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-hungary">Kingdom of Hungary</a>. He fought on the Hungarian side against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a> and was drawn into the Hungarian succession disputes of the early 1160s, after which he disappears from the sources.</p></div>
